    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "His real name is",
        "Adegbenga Otomayomi Adejumo.",
        "Born September 1, 1986.",
        "Croydon, South London.",
        "He went by one word.",
        "Benga."
      ],
      "sub": "One name. One city. One sound."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "At 15, he walked into Big Apple Records.",
        "DJ Hatcha was behind the counter.",
        "Skream was somewhere in the building.",
        "That shop was a laboratory.",
        "And Benga had already started the experiment."
      ],
      "sub": "Croydon, 2001."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "2002. Age 15.",
        "First release: 'Skank'.",
        "Big Apple Records' own label.",
        "The floor didn't know his name yet.",
        "But it already felt what he made."
      ],
      "sub": "Hatcha heard it. Played it."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "2008. 'Diary of an Afro Warrior'.",
        "Tempa Records. 19 tracks.",
        "'Night' with Coki.",
        "'26 Basslines'. 'Emotions'.",
        "It wasn't just an album.",
        "It was the blueprint",
        "for a sound that hadn't had a name long."
      ],
      "sub": "Released March 3rd."
    },
    {
      "type": "body",
      "text": [
        "2010. Magnetic Man.",
        "Benga + Skream + Artwork.",
        "Columbia Records. Sony.",
        "'I Need Air' feat. Katy B.",
        "UK Top 10.",
        "The underground they built",
        "became something else.",
        "He was 23."
      ],
      "sub": "Dubstep reached the mainstream."
    },
    {
      "type": "quote",
      "quote": [
        "'My bipolar was brought on by drugs.",
        "The schizophrenia was the result",
        "of excessive touring.'"
      ],
      "note": "February 2014. He retired. Then came the silence — bipolar disorder, schizophrenia, arrest, sectioned. He said it himself. Quietly. On Twitter. October 2015."
    },
    {
      "type": "cta",
      "text": [
        "February 12, 2016.",
        "He played fabric again.",
        "First time in almost three years.",
        "Building a world has a cost.",
        "He paid it.",
        "He's still here."
      ],
      "strobe": "The weight was real. So was the return.",
      "cta": "Save this."
    }
  ]
